{"id":"a1ff59b2909a8ac7","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-projective-resolution.md","title":"Projective Resolution","display":"df-projective-resolution — Projective Resolution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projective-resolution","aliases":["58-df-projective-resolution","Projective Resolution"],"display":"df-projective-resolution — Projective Resolution","depends_on":["[[58-df-projective-module]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-projective.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projective-resolution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projective-resolution</span><span>Projective Resolution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projective-resolution — Projective Resolution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"427dbff531db1052\" href=\"?note=427dbff531db1052\" title=\"58-df-projective-module\">58-df-projective-module</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25e593b1b8714c23\" href=\"?note=25e593b1b8714c23\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"82508b70140c7533\" href=\"?note=82508b70140c7533\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-projective.md\">../batch01/58-df-projective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R\\in V\">\\(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\)</span> 保留五元存在结构接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A=\\langle A,+_A,0_A,\\lambda_A\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal A=\\langle A,+_A,0_A,\\lambda_A\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(n)=\\langle P(n),+_n,0_n,\\lambda_n\\rangle\">\\(U(n)=\\langle P(n),+_n,0_n,\\lambda_n\\rangle\\)</span> 为下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}\\)</span> 的显式结构参数；分量记号只在相应记录域使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,U\">\\(P,U\\)</span> 是定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的集合函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^I\">\\(V^I\\)</span> 仅缩写定义域为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的集合函数类，不形成真类幂集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S\\)</span> 使用书内指定结构版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ker(f)=\\{x:f(x)=0_{\\mathrm{cod}(f)}\\}\">\\(\\ker(f)=\\{x:f(x)=0_{\\mathrm{cod}(f)}\\}\\)</span> 在下式直接展开，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{im}(f)=\\operatorname{ran}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{im}(f)=\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对有限记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\\)</span>。带结构记录的显式谓词中，运算及零元记号均缩写当前记录的对应分量；记录格式不满足时该谓词为假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(\\mathcal A,A,\\mathcal R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_A,0_A,\\lambda_A\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal A=\\langle A,+_A,0_A,\\lambda_A\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(A,R,+_A,0_A,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\lambda_A)\n\\land0_A\\in A\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;x+_A0_A=x\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(\\mathcal A,A,\\mathcal R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_A,0_A,\\lambda_A\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal A=\\langle A,+_A,0_A,\\lambda_A\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(A,R,+_A,0_A,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\lambda_A)\n\\land0_A\\in A\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;x+_A0_A=x\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R,\\mathcal A,U)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(\\mathcal A,A,\\mathcal R)\n\\land P,U\\in V^\\omega\\land d\\in V^{\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(U(n),P(n),\\mathcal R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S(P(n),R,+_n,0_n,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\lambda_n)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(\\varepsilon;P(0),+_0,\\lambda_0;A,+_A,\\lambda_A;R)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varepsilon)=A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{x\\in P(0):\\varepsilon(x)=0_A\\}=\\operatorname{ran}(d(1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(d(n);P(n),+_n,\\lambda_n;P(n-1),+_{n-1},\\lambda_{n-1};R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\{x\\in P(n):d(n)(x)=0_{n-1}\\}=\\operatorname{ran}(d(n+1))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R,\\mathcal A,U)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(\\mathcal A,A,\\mathcal R)\n\\land P,U\\in V^\\omega\\land d\\in V^{\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(U(n),P(n),\\mathcal R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S(P(n),R,+_n,0_n,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\lambda_n)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(\\varepsilon;P(0),+_0,\\lambda_0;A,+_A,\\lambda_A;R)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varepsilon)=A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{x\\in P(0):\\varepsilon(x)=0_A\\}=\\operatorname{ran}(d(1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(d(n);P(n),+_n,\\lambda_n;P(n-1),+_{n-1},\\lambda_{n-1};R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\{x\\in P(n):d(n)(x)=0_{n-1}\\}=\\operatorname{ran}(d(n+1))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal R,\\mathcal A,U\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R,\\mathcal A,U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal R,\\mathcal A,U\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R,\\mathcal A,U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对每个模和每条箭头固定一次共同结构，再检验增广正合序列；五元接口仍是存在结构的兼容投影。核的零元现在由同一目标模结构确定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rotman, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n<li>Weibel, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-projective-module","status":"resolved","id":"427dbff531db1052","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-projective-module]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"25e593b1b8714c23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-projective.md","status":"resolved","id":"82508b70140c7533","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-projective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Module}$ 取 [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolution}_S(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A=\\langle A,+_A,0_A,\\lambda_A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"U(n)=\\langle P(n),+_n,0_n,\\lambda_n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"P,U","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V^I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S",